.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH analyse 1  "analyse " 
.SH NAME
analyse \- Analyse current changes (default when no subcommand is given)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBanalyse\fR [\fB\-\-staged\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Analyse current changes (default when no subcommand is given)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-staged\fR
Analyse only staged (index) changes instead of all uncommitted changes
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
